{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE ART OF TRANSMUTATION AND CONQUER ETHERIA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master of Cladia</strong> is a massive-scale, turn-based strategy game where alchemy is more than a craft\u2014it is your ultimate weapon. As an elite Alchemist, you must manage resources, quell rebellions, and expand your borders within a persistent world shared by hundreds of players. Your goal is absolute: gather the fragments of the ancestral talisman and claim the supreme throne of Cladia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/extras/1529fea408d8b2ed6997bdfa095b9b3a.poster.avif?t=1773926433\" width=720 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/extras/1529fea408d8b2ed6997bdfa095b9b3a.webm?t=1773926433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/extras/1529fea408d8b2ed6997bdfa095b9b3a.mp4?t=1773926433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HATCH POWERFUL DRAGONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed and evolve legendary dragons, turning them into the tactical core of your armies to crush all opposition. Every creature is a strategic investment: decide their lineage, enhance their abilities, and deploy them on the battlefield to shift the tides of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/extras/8326c38067e01360c7a6637c064a4fe0.poster.avif?t=1773926433\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/extras/8326c38067e01360c7a6637c064a4fe0.webm?t=1773926433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/extras/8326c38067e01360c7a6637c064a4fe0.mp4?t=1773926433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPERIMENT WITH ALCHEMY TO DISCOVER SPELLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knowledge is true power. Utilize the advanced alchemy system to transmute raw elements into devastating formulas and spells that defy the laws of nature. Experiment with secret combinations to bless your troops, curse your rivals, or stabilize your cities' economy before your enemies can strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/extras/9a856789f89c9573aede87358ff002f7.poster.avif?t=1773926433\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/extras/9a856789f89c9573aede87358ff002f7.webm?t=1773926433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/extras/9a856789f89c9573aede87358ff002f7.mp4?t=1773926433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEAT YOUR ENEMIES AND REACH SUPREME GLORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diplomacy has its limits; conquest has none. Lead large-scale military campaigns, lay siege to enemy strongholds, and defend your territory in an asynchronous multiplayer system that rewards cold planning over quick reflexes. Forge temporary alliances or rule alone, but remember: in Cladia, only the cunning survive the passing of turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/extras/59dcff9f5cb3560495f3c318f2532ab4.poster.avif?t=1773926433\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/extras/59dcff9f5cb3560495f3c318f2532ab4.webm?t=1773926433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/extras/59dcff9f5cb3560495f3c318f2532ab4.mp4?t=1773926433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the alchemist who brings peace through science, or the tyrant who rides over the ashes of his enemies? <strong>The throne of Cladia awaits. Claim it.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3732690?t=1773926433","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/c3d0667934e8a6346622972fa9ba181486820e6a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773926433","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/b96247cec9b2b58274974fc69e2c424a2a78d4de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773926433","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/b96247cec9b2b58274974fc69e2c424a2a78d4de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773926433","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4130200,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE ART OF TRANSMUTATION AND CONQUER ETHERIA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master of Cladia</strong> is a massive-scale, turn-based strategy game where alchemy is more than a craft\u2014it is your ultimate weapon. As an elite Alchemist, you must manage resources, quell rebellions, and expand your borders within a persistent world shared by hundreds of players. Your goal is absolute: gather the fragments of the ancestral talisman and claim the supreme throne of Cladia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/extras/1529fea408d8b2ed6997bdfa095b9b3a.poster.avif?t=1773926433\" width=720 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/extras/1529fea408d8b2ed6997bdfa095b9b3a.webm?t=1773926433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/extras/1529fea408d8b2ed6997bdfa095b9b3a.mp4?t=1773926433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HATCH POWERFUL DRAGONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed and evolve legendary dragons, turning them into the tactical core of your armies to crush all opposition. Every creature is a strategic investment: decide their lineage, enhance their abilities, and deploy them on the battlefield to shift the tides of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732690/extras/8326c38067e01360c7a6637c064a4fe0.poster.avif?t=1773926433\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite